    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">ABOUT RAISE YOUR TRIBE</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">An immersive survival experience that combines looter shooter, horror, survival mechanics, and realistic sim elements.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Highly optimized</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A vast open world full of exploration opportunities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play with your friends</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Story with advanced dialog system</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Base building</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Vehicles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">An online dedicated PvP server update will be added later, already tested with over 1,000 playtesters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">And much more...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1908530/extras/9fcb40ee72a1459b5d92ced3a616cadd.poster.avif?t=1741940354\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1908530/extras/9fcb40ee72a1459b5d92ced3a616cadd.webm?t=1741940354\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1908530/extras/9fcb40ee72a1459b5d92ced3a616cadd.mp4?t=1741940354\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">ABOUT RAISE YOUR TRIBE</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">An immersive survival experience that combines looter shooter, horror, survival mechanics, and realistic sim elements.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Highly optimized</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A vast open world full of exploration opportunities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play with your friends</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Story with advanced dialog system</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Base building</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Vehicles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">An online dedicated PvP server update will be added later, already tested with over 1,000 playtesters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">And much more...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1908530/extras/9fcb40ee72a1459b5d92ced3a616cadd.poster.avif?t=1741940354\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1908530/extras/9fcb40ee72a1459b5d92ced3a616cadd.webm?t=1741940354\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1908530/extras/9fcb40ee72a1459b5d92ced3a616cadd.mp4?t=1741940354\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "A hardcore tactical shooter with horror elements. Battle Machines and Mutants, and build your legacy on a deadly post-apocalyptic Cyberpunk Island. Explore dangerous zones, craft powerful gear, and shape your Cyberware build. Uncover secrets and fight to survive in a brutal, immersive world!",
